{"name": "Relicfall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FORGE YOUR OWN CLASS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose <strong>3 professions</strong> and combine them to shape a unique skill tree. Each profession brings its own mechanics and specializations, opening different paths with every new combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/9b8075a1aa512eade5c7f3e8912fba12.poster.avif?t=1788287727\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/9b8075a1aa512eade5c7f3e8912fba12.webm?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/9b8075a1aa512eade5c7f3e8912fba12.mp4?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOCKET. MODIFY. BREAK THE RULES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Active relics are your abilities.</strong> Find new ones as you play, then socket them with support relics that change how they behave. Make projectiles <strong>chain, pierce, fork, explode</strong>, or combine multiple effects to transform a simple ability into something completely different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/4df3e970315278e8ed4e47b8aad97987.poster.avif?t=1788287727\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/4df3e970315278e8ed4e47b8aad97987.webm?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/4df3e970315278e8ed4e47b8aad97987.mp4?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HUNT FOR POWERFUL LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slaughter enemies and bosses for equipment with randomized stats and powerful effects. Hunt for pieces that complement your build, equip them, and push your character even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/bc50ba313995c62a00f300076bb3714c.poster.avif?t=1788287727\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/bc50ba313995c62a00f300076bb3714c.webm?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/extras/bc50ba313995c62a00f300076bb3714c.mp4?t=1788287727\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Forge your own class in this Bullet Heaven Action Roguelite. Combine 3 professions to shape a unique skill tree, hunt for powerful loot, and socket relics to create game-breaking synergies. Slay endless hordes and push your build to its limits.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357240/56a6540d8b168dfbb5daf15753615705d26ead4f/header.jpg?t=1788287727", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Loot", "Action RPG", "Hack and Slash"], "developers": "Liviu G.", "publishers": "Liviu G.", "release_date": "Q3 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4357240", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/yJPWJBfh440", "first_seen": 1788213600.0, "review_rank": 9}